{
"title": "7. Decimals",
"tests": [
{"q": [
{"t": "Write 0.5 as a fraction in lowest terms.", "o": ["1/2", "5/100", "1/5", "5/1"], "k": "F('0.5')", "e": "0.5 means 5 tenths = 5/10 = 1/2."},
{"t": "Write ‘three tenths’ as a decimal.", "n": 0.3, "e": "The first place after the point is the tenths place."},
{"t": "Find 2.5 + 1.2.", "n": 3.7, "k": "F('2.5')+F('1.2')", "e": "Add tenths to tenths and ones to ones: 5 + 2 = 7 tenths, 2 + 1 = 3 ones."},
{"t": "Which is greater: 0.7 or 0.07?", "o": ["0.7", "0.07", "They are equal"], "e": "0.7 is 7 tenths; 0.07 is only 7 hundredths — ten times smaller."},
{"t": "Write 7/10 as a decimal.", "n": 0.7, "k": "F(7,10)", "e": "7 tenths goes in the tenths place: 0.7."},
{"t": "Find 4.6 − 1.3.", "n": 3.3, "k": "F('4.6')-F('1.3')", "e": "6 tenths − 3 tenths = 3 tenths; 4 − 1 = 3."},
{"t": "In 2.35, the digit 5 is in which place?", "o": ["Hundredths", "Tenths", "Ones", "Thousandths"], "e": "After the point come tenths, then hundredths. 5 is second."},
{"t": "Write 1/4 as a decimal.", "n": 0.25, "k": "F(1,4)", "e": "1/4 = 25/100 = 0.25."},
{"t": "Write 25 paise in rupees.", "o": ["₹0.25", "₹2.5", "₹0.025", "₹25"], "k": "F(25,100)", "e": "100 paise make ₹1, so 25 paise = 25/100 = ₹0.25."},
{"t": "Which decimal is equal to 3.0?", "o": ["3", "0.3", "30", "3.03"], "e": "A zero after the last decimal digit adds nothing: 3.0 is 3 and no tenths."}
]},
{"q": [
{"t": "Find 3.75 + 2.8.", "n": 6.55, "k": "F('3.75')+F('2.8')", "e": "Line up the points and write 2.8 as 2.80: 3.75 + 2.80 = 6.55."},
{"t": "Find 10 − 4.37.", "n": 5.63, "k": "10-F('4.37')", "e": "Write 10 as 10.00: 10.00 − 4.37 = 5.63."},
{"t": "Write 0.125 as a fraction in lowest terms.", "o": ["1/8", "1/125", "125/100", "5/8"], "k": "F('0.125')", "e": "125/1000, and dividing top and bottom by 125 gives 1/8."},
{"t": "Write 5 cm in metres.", "n": 0.05, "u": "m", "k": "F(5,100)", "e": "1 cm = 1/100 m, so 5 cm = 0.05 m."},
{"t": "Write 2 kg 50 g in kilograms.", "n": 2.05, "u": "kg", "k": "2+F(50,1000)", "e": "50 g = 50/1000 kg = 0.050 kg. Total 2.05 kg (not 2.5)."},
{"t": "Arrange in ascending order: 0.5, 0.45, 0.405, 0.54", "o": ["0.405, 0.45, 0.5, 0.54", "0.45, 0.405, 0.5, 0.54", "0.5, 0.45, 0.54, 0.405", "0.54, 0.5, 0.45, 0.405"], "e": "Give all three places: 0.500, 0.450, 0.405, 0.540. Then compare like whole numbers: 405, 450, 500, 540."},
{"t": "Write 3 2/5 as a decimal.", "n": 3.4, "k": "3+F(2,5)", "e": "2/5 = 4/10 = 0.4, so 3.4."},
{"t": "Find 7.2 − 3.85.", "n": 3.35, "k": "F('7.2')-F('3.85')", "e": "7.20 − 3.85 = 3.35."},
