{"t": "Write 20 + 3 + 4/10 + 7/1000 as a decimal.", "n": 23.407, "k": "20+3+F(4,10)+F(7,1000)", "e": "There are no hundredths, so that place gets a 0: 23.407."}
]},
{"q": [
{"t": "Find 12.5 + 3.75 − 8.125.", "n": 8.125, "k": "F('12.5')+F('3.75')-F('8.125')", "e": "12.500 + 3.750 = 16.250, then 16.250 − 8.125 = 8.125."},
{"t": "Meena has ₹100. She spends ₹15.50, ₹28.75 and ₹9.25. How much is left (in ₹)?", "n": 46.5, "u": "₹", "k": "100-F('15.5')-F('28.75')-F('9.25')", "e": "Spent: 15.50 + 28.75 + 9.25 = 53.50. Left: 100 − 53.50 = 46.50."},
{"t": "A triangle has sides 3.4 cm, 4.75 cm and 5.2 cm. Find its perimeter (in cm).", "n": 13.35, "u": "cm", "k": "F('3.4')+F('4.75')+F('5.2')", "e": "3.40 + 4.75 + 5.20 = 13.35."},
