{"t": "Which is the greatest: 2.3, 2.03, 2.303 or 2.33?", "o": ["2.33", "2.303", "2.3", "2.03"], "e": "As 2.300, 2.030, 2.303, 2.330 — the largest is 2.330."},
{"t": "Find 4 m 5 cm − 2 m 75 cm in metres.", "n": 1.3, "u": "m", "k": "F('4.05')-F('2.75')", "e": "4.05 m − 2.75 m = 1.30 m. (4 m 5 cm is 4.05, not 4.5.)"},
{"t": "What must be added to 5.384 to get 9?", "n": 3.616, "k": "9-F('5.384')", "e": "9.000 − 5.384 = 3.616."},
