{"t": "From a 20 m rope, pieces of 3.75 m, 4.5 m and 6.125 m are cut. How much is left (in m)?", "n": 5.625, "u": "m", "k": "20-F('3.75')-F('4.5')-F('6.125')", "e": "Cut: 3.750 + 4.500 + 6.125 = 14.375. Left: 20 − 14.375 = 5.625."},
