{"t": "If 15.7 − x = 8.96, find x.", "n": 6.74, "k": "F('15.7')-F('8.96')", "e": "x = 15.70 − 8.96 = 6.74."},
{"t": "Find 2.5 km + 750 m − 1.325 km, in km.", "n": 1.925, "u": "km", "k": "F('2.5')+F('0.75')-F('1.325')", "e": "2.500 + 0.750 = 3.250; 3.250 − 1.325 = 1.925."},
{"t": "Ravi has ₹50. He buys a pen for ₹12.75 and a notebook for ₹23.50. How much MORE money does he need to buy a ₹20 book (in ₹)?", "n": 6.25, "u": "₹", "k": "20-(50-F('12.75')-F('23.5'))", "e": "Left: 50 − 36.25 = 13.75. He needs 20 − 13.75 = 6.25 more."},
